OL,3,AHow new US chip restrictions on South
OL,4,AEast Asia will hit China
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs US President Donald Trump heads to
OL,7,FChina, his administration has renewed
OL,8,Fefforts to curb Beijing's access to
OL,9,Fadvanced semiconductors.
OL,11,FOn Monday, Washington announced new
OL,12,Finterim rules that will increase
OL,13,Fscrutiny of data centre operators in
OL,14,FSingapore, Malaysia, Thailand,
OL,15,FIndonesia and Brazil.
OL,17,FThe move not only restricts the export
OL,18,Fof advanced chips, but also access to
OL,19,Ftheir computing power, which Chinese
OL,20,Ffirms currently rent abroad to train
OL,21,Fartificial intelligence (AI) models.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/19
