OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,ANHS data contract to stay with Palantir
OL,4,Auntil 2029
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Commons Committee had called on the
OL,7,Fgovernment to part ways and appoint a
OL,8,Fcompany "more compatible with UK
OL,9,Fvalues". Protesters regularly target
OL,10,FPalantir over Israel's use of its
OL,11,Ftechnology in the Gaza conflict and
OL,12,Foppose its use in US immigration
OL,13,Fenforcement.
OL,15,FThe #330m deal, which began in 2024 to
OL,16,Fhelp manage hospital waiting lists in
OL,17,FEngland, was due to run until 2031.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/19
