OL,3,ABatman to James Bond: The clues about
OL,4,Awhat to expect from Robert Pattinson's
OL,5,A007
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe has been in big-budget blockbusters
OL,8,Flike Twilight, Tenet and The Batman, as
OL,9,Fwell as a string of quirky arthouse
OL,10,Ffilms - so what clues can Robert
OL,11,FPattinson's past roles give us about
OL,12,Fwhat he might be like as James Bond?
OL,14,FEvery actor creates a new James Bond,
OL,15,Fand Pattinson is one of the best in the
OL,16,Fbusiness at crafting a memorable
OL,17,Fcharacter.
OL,19,FThe British actor can be an action man
OL,20,For an anti-hero, a romantic lead or a
OL,21,Fcomic fool. He can be granite-faced or
OL,22,Fgoofy, and everything in between.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
