OL,3,AHunger Games prequel splits opinion:
OL,4,A'Surreally awful' or 'surprisingly
OL,5,Astrong'
OL,6,
OL,7,FReviews of the latest Hunger Games film
OL,8,Fhave seen it dismissed as a "surreally
OL,9,Fawful prequel" and "a tortuous, costly
OL,10,Fmess" by some critics - but called
OL,11,F"surprisingly strong" and "one of the
OL,12,Fbest films in the series" by others.
OL,14,FThe Hunger Games: Sunrise on the
OL,15,FReaping is the sixth movie in the
OL,16,Ffranchise, and tells the origin story
OL,17,Fof a teenage Haymitch Abernathy - who
OL,18,Fwas played as an adult by Woody
OL,19,FHarrelson.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,164,160,200,105,0,100
