OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AHunger Games prequel splits opinion:
OL,4,A'Surreally awful' or 'surprisingly
OL,5,Astrong'
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn a one-star review, the Guardian
OL,8,Fcalled the film "overwrought and
OL,9,Fboring", and said it "has no actual
OL,10,Finterest and no authentic reason to
OL,11,Fexist, other than to gouge an income
OL,12,Fstream out of its fanbase".
OL,14,FBut the Wrap praised its "memorable
OL,15,Fperformances, intoxicating style and
OL,16,Fhorrifying commentary", adding: "When
OL,17,Fthe dust settles it may even be the
OL,18,FHunger Games that holds up best."
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
